      "text": "31 August 2026 Current Affairs in Hindi & English\n\n➼ Kyrgyzstan में 2026 के 6th World Nomad Games का आयोजन किया जा रहा है।\nThe 6th World Nomad Games 2026 are being held in Kyrgyzstan.\n\n➼ Lenin Moreno को hydroelectric project bribery case में 5 वर्ष की सजा हुई। वे Ecuador के पूर्व राष्ट्रपति हैं।\nLenin Moreno, who was sentenced to five years in a hydroelectric project bribery case, is the former President of Ecuador.\n\n➼ Argentina ने फाइनल में Netherlands को हराकर Women’s FIH Hockey World Cup 2026 का खिताब जीता।\nArgentina defeated the Netherlands in the final to win the Women’s FIH Hockey World Cup 2026 title.\n\n➼ R. Praggnanandhaa St. Louis में Grand Chess Tour (GCT) Finals जीतने वाले पहले भारतीय बने।\nR. Praggnanandhaa became the first Indian chess player to win the Grand Chess Tour (GCT) Finals in St. Louis.\n\n➼ R. Vaishali Women’s Candidates Chess Tournament जीतकर World Championship Match के लिए qualify करने वाली पहली भारतीय महिला खिलाड़ी बनीं।\nR. Vaishali became the first Indian female player to qualify for the World Championship Match by winning the Women’s Candidates Chess Tournament.\n\n➼ 46th FIDE Chess Olympiad सितंबर 2026 में Samarkand, Uzbekistan में आयोजित होगा।\nThe 46th FIDE Chess Olympiad will be held in Samarkand, Uzbekistan, in September 2026.\n\n➼ 2026 Asian Games का आयोजन Aichi-Nagoya, Japan में किया जा रहा है।\nThe 2026 Asian Games are being held in Aichi-Nagoya, Japan.\n\n➼ Uttar Pradesh ने 60 वर्ष और उससे अधिक आयु की महिलाओं के लिए Lokmata Ahilyabai Matrushakti Yatra Yojana शुरू की।\nUttar Pradesh launched the Lokmata Ahilyabai Matrushakti Yatra Yojana to provide free travel facilities in state buses to women aged 60 and above.\n\n➼ बिहार की Mukhyamantri Balika Ph.D. Fellowship Scheme के तहत पात्र छात्राओं को 4 वर्षों तक ₹10,000 प्रति माह दिए जाएंगे।\nUnder Bihar’s Mukhyamantri Balika Ph.D. Fellowship Scheme, eligible female students will receive ₹10,000 per month for four years.\n\n➼ FSSAI ने HFSS foods में अधिक fat, sugar और salt की चेतावनी के लिए Red Hexagon label प्रस्तावित किया है।\nFSSAI has proposed a Red Hexagon label to warn consumers about high levels of fat, sugar and salt in packaged foods.\n\n➼ Sharavathi Pumped Storage Hydroelectric Project की प्रस्तावित क्षमता 2,000 MW है और यह Karnataka में स्थित है।\nThe proposed Sharavathi Pumped Storage Hydroelectric Project has a capacity of 2,000 MW and is located in Karnataka.\n\n➼ Odisha ने ADB की सहायता से छह coastal districts में coastal erosion रोकने के लिए ₹2,500 करोड़ की परियोजना को मंजूरी दी।\nOdisha approved a ₹2,500 crore ADB-assisted project to prevent coastal erosion in six coastal districts.\n\n➼ CII E Amravati Chapter ने एक ही दिन में सर्वाधिक indigenous bamboo seed balls तैयार करने के लिए Asia Book of Records में स्थान बनाया।\nCII E Amravati Chapter entered the Asia Book of Records for preparing the highest number of indigenous bamboo seed balls in a single day.\n\n➼ Andhra Pradesh ने CA firms और MSMEs के लिए AI-driven Pramaan OS लॉन्च किया।\nAndhra Pradesh launched the AI-driven Pramaan OS for Chartered Accountant firms and MSMEs.\n\n➼ GRSE (Garden Reach Shipbuilders & Engineers), Kolkata गंगा नदी के लिए देश के पहले fully battery-operated eco-friendly passenger vessels का निर्माण कर रहा है।\nGRSE (Garden Reach Shipbuilders & Engineers), Kolkata is constructing India’s first fully battery-operated eco-friendly passenger vessels for operation on the Ganga River.",
